    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rake is a First-Person Horror game where you hunt down (or be hunted by) a creature known as &quot;The Rake&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have arrived in a forest where there have been a large number of mysterious\u00a0 disappearances,\u00a0You the perfectly sane Gordon Davis are tasked with hunting down The Rake whom you believe is responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day you can explore the forest and place Trail Cameras on trees and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also find items like Bear Traps and other weapons that can assist in your objective to hunt it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the night The Rake will emerge. You can stay in your camper van and use the cameras you placed during the day to observe and locate The Rake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rake is a First-Person Horror game where you hunt down (or be hunted by) a creature known as &quot;The Rake&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have arrived in a forest where there have been a large number of mysterious\u00a0 disappearances,\u00a0You the perfectly sane Gordon Davis are tasked with hunting down The Rake whom you believe is responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day you can explore the forest and place Trail Cameras on trees and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also find items like Bear Traps and other weapons that can assist in your objective to hunt it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the night The Rake will emerge. You can stay in your camper van and use the cameras you placed during the day to observe and locate The Rake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
